    ),
    // The illustrated shorts (change jf9k) — appended after all existing
    // entries (the o33t/cdbr/37ng/tx5p/4vkd convention), matching its
    // COMMANDS position. `man play` answers via the o33t bridge.
    play: helpDetail(
      'play <tool> — a ~10s illustrated short of what a tool does',
      "honest fake: nothing really runs. ends at the tool's pages. Ctrl-C bails.",
    ),
    // The arcade pass (change kd5e) — appended after all existing entries
    // (the o33t/cdbr/37ng/tx5p/4vkd/jf9k convention), matching their
    // COMMANDS positions in ascending-effort order. All three are unlisted
    // eggs: answered here and by `man <cmd>` via the o33t bridge, never
    // enumerated in bare `help`.
    cowsay: helpDetail(
      'cowsay [text] — a cow says your text',
      "no text? the cow borrows a fortune. they share a writers' room.",
    ),
    cmatrix: helpDetail(
